{"identifier":"Careofth1949","title":"Care of the Skin","description":"Structure of the skin; good cleanliness habits; the proper way to wash; the correct use of soap.","videoUrl":"https://archive.org/download/Careofth1949/Careofth1949_512kb.mp4","thumbnailUrl":"https://archive.org/services/img/Careofth1949","sourcePageUrl":"https://archive.org/details/Careofth1949","durationMs":625000,"level":"B1","topic":"Health and hygiene;Medicine: Dermatology","sourceCredit":"Source: Internet Archive — Care of the Skin","hasCaptions":true,"segments":[{"startMs":21000,"endMs":26001,"text":"[\"The Star-Spangled Banner\"] But Virginia was washing themselves."},{"startMs":27001,"endMs":28001,"text":"So he'll be clean."},{"startMs":29000,"endMs":29001,"text":"Why?"},{"startMs":29001,"endMs":32000,"text":"Oh, just because."},{"startMs":34001,"endMs":35001,"text":"Hey, Virginia."},{"startMs":36000,"endMs":38001,"text":"Come on out more before I start my bath."},{"startMs":39000,"endMs":39001,"text":"All right, Fred."},{"startMs":41001,"endMs":43000,"text":"Come on, Billy. Let's go upstairs."},{"startMs":44000,"endMs":44001,"text":"Wait, Virginia."},{"startMs":45000,"endMs":46000,"text":"I can work right here."},{"startMs":46001,"endMs":47000,"text":"Look!"},{"startMs":49001,"endMs":51000,"text":"Oh, Billy, they're no good."},{"startMs":51000,"endMs":51001,"text":"Why?"},{"startMs":52000,"endMs":53000,"text":"That's just silly."},{"startMs":54000,"endMs":55001,"text":"Oh, because."},{"startMs":56001,"endMs":57000,"text":"Come on, Billy."},{"startMs":65001,"endMs":72000,"text":"[\"The Star-Spangled Banner\"] Virginia doesn't know the answer to Billy's question."},{"startMs":72001,"endMs":74001,"text":"Let's see if we can explain it."},{"startMs":77000,"endMs":81000,"text":"You and I have a coat of armor that protects our bodies from the outside world."},{"startMs":81001,"endMs":82001,"text":"It's our skin."},{"startMs":83000,"endMs":84001,"text":"We wash it with soap and water."},{"startMs":85001,"endMs":87000,"text":"Well, there's a special reason."},{"startMs":92000,"endMs":94001,"text":"Look at your skin through a magnifying glass."},{"startMs":95000,"endMs":97001,"text":"It looks like it's full of tiny holes, doesn't it?"},{"startMs":98000,"endMs":99001,"text":"These holes are called pores."},{"startMs":100001,"endMs":102001,"text":"Some have little hairs growing out of them."},{"startMs":106001,"endMs":109000,"text":"But did you know that you really have two skins?"},{"startMs":112000,"endMs":114001,"text":"The one you see is the outer skin."},{"startMs":114001,"endMs":116001,"text":"It's the toughest part of this coat of armor."},{"startMs":119000,"endMs":121001,"text":"Underneath it is another layer, the inner skin."},{"startMs":125000,"endMs":127000,"text":"And beneath this is a layer of fat."},{"startMs":129001,"endMs":133001,"text":"In this fatty layer are sweat glands, lots of them all over your body."},{"startMs":134000,"endMs":138001,"text":"There are special kinds of sweat glands under your arms and in other parts of your skin."},{"startMs":139001,"endMs":144001,"text":"These glands have little ducts to carry the sweat or perspiration to the outside air."},{"startMs":144001,"endMs":148000,"text":"Most of the time, the sweat dries as fast as it comes out."},{"startMs":148001,"endMs":150001,"text":"But sometimes it collects in little drops."},{"startMs":151000,"endMs":154000,"text":"The air dries this sweat and that helps to keep you cool."},{"startMs":157001,"endMs":160001,"text":"Every hair grows from a tiny root."},{"startMs":161000,"endMs":163000,"text":"These roots are in the fatty layer too."},{"startMs":165000,"endMs":168000,"text":"Around the hairs and in other parts of the skin are oil glands."},{"startMs":169000,"endMs":171001,"text":"They open on the outer skin like the sweat glands."},{"startMs":172000,"endMs":175000,"text":"These openings are some of the pores that you can see in your skin."},{"startMs":177001,"endMs":181000,"text":"The oil made in these glands spreads over your skin and helps to keep it soft."},{"startMs":184000,"endMs":187000,"text":"When you get dirty, the dirt sticks in this oil."},{"startMs":187001,"endMs":188001,"text":"Germs do too."},{"startMs":189000,"endMs":191000,"text":"You can't get them off with plain water."},{"startMs":193001,"endMs":198000,"text":"To get off this mixture of oil, dirt, and germs, you have to use soap."},{"startMs":199000,"endMs":201000,"text":"Soap has a special way of cutting into the oil."},{"startMs":201000,"endMs":204001,"text":"It breaks the oil up into tiny drops and surrounds each drop."},{"startMs":205000,"endMs":211000,"text":"When you wash off the soap, the oil, dirt, and germs come off with it, and your skin is fresh and clean."},{"startMs":211001,"endMs":214001,"text":"And that's the special reason why people wash with soap."},{"startMs":216001,"endMs":222001,"text":"From the time you were born, you have this living coat of armor."},{"startMs":223000,"endMs":226001,"text":"It keeps out germs and dirt as long as it isn't broken or cut."},{"startMs":229000,"endMs":231000,"text":"You have many kinds of skin."},{"startMs":231001,"endMs":234000,"text":"Your fingernails are a kind of hardened skin."},{"startMs":234001,"endMs":236000,"text":"Even your hair is a kind of skin."},{"startMs":236001,"endMs":239000,"text":"In fact, most of what people see of you is your skin."},{"startMs":239001,"endMs":243000,"text":"That's still another reason why the care of the skin is so important."},{"startMs":246001,"endMs":249001,"text":"Your skin can get sick just like any part of your body."},{"startMs":250000,"endMs":252001,"text":"And when it does, a doctor can help it to get well."},{"startMs":253000,"endMs":258000,"text":"But if you keep your skin clean, there's less chance that a disease will be able to get started."},{"startMs":259001,"endMs":262000,"text":"This boy's skin has a disease called eczema."},{"startMs":262000,"endMs":265001,"text":"If it isn't taken care of, it may get dangerously infected."},{"startMs":268000,"endMs":271000,"text":"Infections like this are painful and hard to get rid of."},{"startMs":273000,"endMs":274001,"text":"This is athlete's foot."},{"startMs":274001,"endMs":277001,"text":"To guard against it, keep your toes dry and clean."},{"startMs":278001,"endMs":283000,"text":"And chapped hands can come from a little thing like not drying carefully."},{"startMs":285000,"endMs":287001,"text":"Virginia knows how to take care of her skin."},{"startMs":288000,"endMs":290000,"text":"She washes her hands at least four times a day."},{"startMs":291000,"endMs":295001,"text":"She washes everywhere between her fingers too, with plenty of soap and warm water."},{"startMs":298001,"endMs":302000,"text":"She knows that germs like to hide under fingernails."},{"startMs":302001,"endMs":305000,"text":"A stiff fingernail brush gets them out."},{"startMs":306001,"endMs":311000,"text":"It brushes the cuticle off her nails too and leaves her nails bright and pretty."},{"startMs":313000,"endMs":317000,"text":"And now her face, a soapy washcloth, keeps from splashing water."},{"startMs":321000,"endMs":323001,"text":"She washes her face at least every morning and evening."},{"startMs":324000,"endMs":326001,"text":"She rubs gently all over her face."},{"startMs":327001,"endMs":329001,"text":"She washes right up to the edge of her hair."},{"startMs":329001,"endMs":333000,"text":"She rubs carefully to get all the dirt out of the pores so they won't clog."},{"startMs":336000,"endMs":339000,"text":"Here's a place where dirt collects pretty fast."},{"startMs":339000,"endMs":344001,"text":"She washes her ears inside and behind every time she washes her face."},{"startMs":347000,"endMs":351000,"text":"And now her neck, she gets the front of it and she doesn't forget the back."},{"startMs":352000,"endMs":356001,"text":"You won't ever find a high watermark on Virginia's neck after she has washed herself."},{"startMs":359001,"endMs":360000,"text":"Who is it?"},{"startMs":362000,"endMs":364000,"text":"Hurry up, Virginia. I want a wash."},{"startMs":365000,"endMs":366000,"text":"I'll be waiting a minute, Billy."},{"startMs":367000,"endMs":370000,"text":"He'll have to wait till Virginia rinses herself."},{"startMs":370001,"endMs":373000,"text":"First, she gets all the soap out of the washcloth."},{"startMs":373001,"endMs":376001,"text":"And then she uses the washcloth to take the soap off her face."},{"startMs":377000,"endMs":379000,"text":"She's careful to get every bit of it off."},{"startMs":380000,"endMs":385000,"text":"Soap left on the skin makes it feel dry and tight and makes it easier for the skin to chap."},{"startMs":387001,"endMs":394001,"text":"She gets all the soap out of her ears and from behind her ears too."},{"startMs":395000,"endMs":400000,"text":"And then she rinses her neck, the front of her neck and the back."},{"startMs":400001,"endMs":403001,"text":"She gets underneath her hair to make sure no soap has been left there."},{"startMs":405000,"endMs":410000,"text":"Now a final rinsing to get all the soap and dirt out of the washcloth before she hangs it up to dry."},{"startMs":411000,"endMs":415001,"text":"She rinses the basin too so it will be clean and neat for the next person who uses it."},{"startMs":419000,"endMs":421000,"text":"Not that it matters to Billy."},{"startMs":421000,"endMs":425000,"text":"As far as he's concerned, he's been waiting much too long already."},{"startMs":426001,"endMs":428001,"text":"But Virginia won't be rushed."},{"startMs":429000,"endMs":432000,"text":"She knows that drying is just as important as washing."},{"startMs":432001,"endMs":437001,"text":"A good job of drying leaves the skin more comfortable and helps to prevent chapping."},{"startMs":439001,"endMs":446001,"text":"When Virginia's through, she hangs up her towel so it will dry and because it looks better that way."},{"startMs":447000,"endMs":450000,"text":"Billy's learning to use plenty of soap and water when he washes."},{"startMs":450000,"endMs":454001,"text":"Uh-oh. Looks like that kitten started something."},{"startMs":459000,"endMs":464000,"text":"It's Fred's turn next."},{"startMs":465001,"endMs":468001,"text":"He likes to take his bath every night before going to bed."},{"startMs":471000,"endMs":478000,"text":"He uses plenty of warm water, not too hot and plenty of soap too."},{"startMs":479000,"endMs":482000,"text":"He works up a good lather all over his body."},{"startMs":484000,"endMs":487001,"text":"He's especially careful to do a good job where the skin sweats a lot."},{"startMs":488000,"endMs":490000,"text":"Perspiration sometimes leaves an odor here."},{"startMs":493000,"endMs":497000,"text":"Feet need special attention too. They often sweat inside the shoes."},{"startMs":501000,"endMs":502000,"text":"And now for his back."},{"startMs":502001,"endMs":508000,"text":"A long handled brush with soap on it is a handy thing if you can't reach far enough."},{"startMs":512000,"endMs":514001,"text":"When he's all lanted up, he rinses the soap off."},{"startMs":515000,"endMs":518000,"text":"He's just as careful to get it all off as Virginia is."},{"startMs":518001,"endMs":523000,"text":"Fred bathes every day during the summer and at least three times a week during cold weather."},{"startMs":527000,"endMs":534000,"text":"A brisk rub down with a large soft"},{"startMs":534000,"endMs":535001,"text":"towel tops off the bath."},{"startMs":535001,"endMs":540001,"text":"It speeds up the flow of fresh oil from the oil glands to help keep the skin soft."},{"startMs":541000,"endMs":545001,"text":"And what's more, it gives you that tingling feeling that feels so good after your bath."},{"startMs":549000,"endMs":554001,"text":"Fred's careful to dry between his toes, leaving them damp might let the athlete's foot fungus get started."},{"startMs":558000,"endMs":563001,"text":"Fred's bath takes only a few minutes."},{"startMs":563001,"endMs":567000,"text":"But what a difference it makes in the way he feels."},{"startMs":572000,"endMs":574000,"text":"And now a final look at the bathroom."},{"startMs":575001,"endMs":577000,"text":"Towels folded and humped to dry."},{"startMs":578000,"endMs":581001,"text":"No ring around the tub and the basin rinsed and clean."},{"startMs":582001,"endMs":585000,"text":"Fred's ready to turn in for the night."},{"startMs":587001,"endMs":590000,"text":"Virginia is ready for bed too."},{"startMs":590000,"endMs":595001,"text":"They both know that plenty of rest, anything that helps your health helps your skin too."},{"startMs":598000,"endMs":601000,"text":"Billy's fast asleep."},{"startMs":602001,"endMs":604001,"text":"Well, he should have been asleep long ago."},{"startMs":605000,"endMs":607000,"text":"Seems that he has a problem tonight."},{"startMs":620000,"endMs":625000,"text":"Oh well, someday Billy, you'll find out why people wash with soap."}]}